0..75 Comment "// What a function-typed field refuses. A W-type\'s node may hold a function"
76..154 Comment "// into its own family, and one from it whose domain stands strictly below the"
155..230 Comment "// node (`./curry.gandr`, #517); a family to the left of the arrow where no"
231..309 Comment "// stage reaches is a negative occurrence: applied to other arguments than its"
310..385 Comment "// parameters, or named through a definition of its block, which stands for"
386..464 Comment "// its body and so hides nothing. Shared with `../../model/data/w-tree.gandr`."
